# shell: tracker
# home: fixture
# NeXT UIG ch3: Cmd-Space completes a partial file name wherever one may
# be typed -- here the last component of the location field's path.
wait 8
key l ctrl
wait 3
key /
key t
key m
key p
key /
key t
key r
key k
key _
key h
key o
key m
key e
key /
key D
key e
key s
key k
key space ctrl
wait 3
key Return
wait 8
expect-location /tmp/trk_home/Desktop
quit
